INSERT INTO feature VALUES('top-level-type-members','modules','Type members at a source''s top level','modules','implemented','ordinary',NULL,'`type T = τ ;` at a source''s top level names `τ` for the declarations that follow it. It names `τ` for each declaration of a source that imports it unqualified. A synonym with parameters behaves as a module type member. A use before its member is unresolved. A second member of the same name is refused. A name from two imports is refused at its use. A computation member definition stands where a computation type is read. A returner, a computation record and a function into one are computation definitions. A name of an earlier computation member and an application of an earlier computation family also stand there. A computation member is refused where a value type is read. This includes a seal or an abstract type parameter of a functor.','surface-lowering','corpus/model/modules/top-level-type.gandr corpus/model/modules/top-level-type-imported.gandr corpus/pathological/modules/top-level-type.gandr','corpus/model/modules/top-level-type.gandr',NULL);
